; barua.tz — authoritative export of the Route 53 zone (Z056517927RCLSWZ09U7K,
; AWS account 878021513059), captured 2026-10-07 via list-resource-record-sets.
;
; An earlier version of this file was built by probing DNS and was WRONG: a
; wildcard A masks per-name records, so `dig` cannot enumerate a zone. It missed
; both DKIM records. Flipping nameservers on that list would have left signed
; mail with no published key, and _dmarc says p=quarantine. Always export from
; the provider's API, never from dig.
;
; Every record must be imported DNS-only (grey cloud). Proxying the apex or the
; wildcard would break SMTP 25/587, IMAP and Postgres 5432.
$TTL 300
barua.tz.                        300 IN A     172.233.46.254   ; mail box (barua.tz, www, ui, developer)
*.barua.tz.                      300 IN A     172.233.46.254   ; catch-all -> mail box
developer.barua.tz.              300 IN A     172.233.46.254   ; explicit; was hidden behind the wildcard
storage.barua.tz.                300 IN A     172.233.46.67    ; barua-garage
www.barua.tz.                    300 IN CNAME barua.tz.
bounce.barua.tz.                 300 IN CNAME return.smtp2go.net.
s866777._domainkey.barua.tz.     300 IN CNAME dkim.smtp2go.net.  ; smtp2go DKIM
barua.tz.                        300 IN MX    10 mx.tznova.com.
barua.tz.                        300 IN TXT   "v=spf1 include:spf.smtp2go.com a:mx.tznova.com ~all"
_spf.barua.tz.                   300 IN TXT   "v=spf1 a:mx.tznova.com include:spf.smtp2go.com include:amazonses.com -all"
_dmarc.barua.tz.                 300 IN TXT   "v=DMARC1; p=quarantine; pct=100; rua=mailto:kelvin@barua.tz; adkim=r; aspf=r"
_barua-verify.barua.tz.          300 IN TXT   "barua-verify=YhA65Jy73uYeenTcq5NpeKU-FUZbSVIw"
barua._domainkey.barua.tz.       300 IN TXT   "v=DKIM1; h=sha256; k=rsa; p=…"   ; full key in Route 53 / Cloudflare
;
; All 13 records above are live in the Cloudflare zone 0e0c828b4fa09f56f9e2fa7ed67ca527
; and were verified identical against ns-596.awsdns-10.net on 2026-10-07.
;
; --- BaruaDB's own records ---
; *.pg.barua.tz   A  -> box IP, DNS-only (one box; from the 2nd box the Worker
;                       writes a record per database and per box instead)
; pgapi.barua.tz     -> Worker custom domain, only once barua.tz is active on
;                       Cloudflare; until then the control plane answers on
;                       barua-control.kelvineffect.workers.dev
